	(text "──── ROUTE NOTES ────\n• LDO IN caps within 2 mm of each input pin; OUT caps within 2 mm of each output pin\n• +3V3 and +1V0 are secondary-side rails — keep clear of primary PoE copper pours\n• PWR_FLAG must appear on +3V3 and +1V0 at exactly one location each; this sheet is the right place"
